<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title></title>
</head>
<body><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px;">Assessment plays </span><span style="margin: 0px;">a central role</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> in education: it helps guide learning, makes visible whether learning outcomes have been achieved, and is often necessary for earning credits or degrees.</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> </span><span style="margin: 0px;">In transdisciplinary education, however, assessment brings </span><span style="margin: 0px;">additional</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> </span><span style="margin: 0px;">challenges, because</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> learning is highly </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;">unpredictable</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">, </span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;">personal</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">, and </span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;"><span style="margin: 0px">context-dependent</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">There is still little empirical research on assessment and evaluation in transdisciplinary education</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">(</span><span style="margin: 0px">Swanenberg</span><span style="margin: 0px">, 2024).</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">What is clear: </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">context is key</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span><br style="margin: 0px"></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">Always align with the learning outcomes and learning activities in your specific educational practice — there is no golden standard, but there </span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-style: italic; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">is</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"> a need for careful consideration.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">It’s</span><span style="margin: 0px"> important to reflect on four fundamental questions:</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><div style="margin: 0px"><ol role="list" start="1" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Who assesses?</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ol></div><div style="margin: 0px"><ol role="list" start="2" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">What is the purpose of assessment?</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ol></div><div style="margin: 0px"><ol role="list" start="3" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold"><span style="margin: 0px">What do you </span><span style="margin: 0px">assess</span><span style="margin: 0px">?</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ol></div><div style="margin: 0px"><ol role="list" start="4" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">How do you assess?</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ol></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px"></span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p role="heading" aria-level="4" style="margin: 21.2667px 0px; font-style: italic;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;">Who is involved in the assessment?</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">Transdisciplinary education is based on </span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">equal collaboration</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px"> between students, teachers, practice partners, and sometimes even citizens.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">Yet, assessment in higher education is primarily focused on students.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">This </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">asymmetry</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px"> — only the student is assessed — can clash with the goal of equality in collaboration.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">Although little research is available on this, </span><span style="margin: 0px">it’s</span><span style="margin: 0px"> important to consciously consider the implications of assessment on interpersonal dynamics in your design (Meyer et al., 2025).</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px"></span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p role="heading" aria-level="4" style="margin: 21.2667px 0px; font-style: italic;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">What is the purpose of assessment?</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">Instead of uniform learning goals for all students, transdisciplinary learning often focuses on </span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold"><span style="margin: 0px">personal, professional, and identity development</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">Students bring their own knowledge, experiences, and learning needs.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">Assessment should therefore allow for </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">diversity</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">: it should challenge students to grow, rather than limit them.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">This calls for </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">assessment for learning</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"> (rather than assessment as a final checkpoint), and an approach that values differences between students — known as </span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">“assessment for distinctiveness”</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"> (Jorre de St Jorre &amp; Oliver, 2018).</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px"></span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p role="heading" aria-level="4" style="margin: 21.2667px 0px; font-style: italic;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">What do you assess in transdisciplinary education?</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">Learning outcomes in transdisciplinary education often involve </span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">integration of perspectives</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">, </span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">dealing with complexity</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">, </span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">reflection</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">, and </span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">collaboration</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">Such outcomes are not straightforward and often involve </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">learning surprises</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px"> (</span><span style="margin: 0px">Baggen</span><span style="margin: 0px"> et al., 2022; Gulikers &amp; Oonk, 2019).</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">It’s</span><span style="margin: 0px"> therefore important to create clarity — together with students and stakeholders — about what is considered a </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">valuable result</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">, both in terms of content and process.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Three </span><span style="margin: 0px">possible assessment</span><span style="margin: 0px"> domains:</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><ul role="list" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: verdana"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Societal performance</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"> – contribution to the issue or practice</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ul></div><div style="margin: 0px"><ul role="list" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: verdana"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Process accountability</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"> – how the result was achieved</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ul></div><div style="margin: 0px"><ul role="list" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: verdana"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Personal development</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"> – growth in collaboration, reflection, and role awareness</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ul></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px"></span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px"><p role="heading" aria-level="4" style="margin: 21.2667px 0px; font-style: italic;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">How do you assess?</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><div style="margin: 0px;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">To align with the learning process in transdisciplinary education, a </span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">variety of assessment formats</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"> is needed (Meyer et al., 2025).</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;Examples include:</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><ul role="list" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: verdana"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Product-oriented assessment</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"> – reflects the substantive and practical outcomes (e.g., advice, prototype, or intervention)</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ul></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><ul role="list" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: verdana"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Process-oriented assessment</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"> – makes the development of skills, attitudes, and collaboration visible</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ul></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Tip:</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; text-decoration-line: underline; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;"><span style="margin: 0px">This</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">article</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"> shows how </span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Student-Devised Assessments</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"> in interdisciplinary modules can radically change the way we learn and assess.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><font color="#424242"><br></font></span></p><div style="margin: 0px;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">References:</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><p style="margin: auto 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Baggen</span><span style="margin: 0px">, Y., Lans, T., &amp; Gulikers, J. (2022). Making entrepreneurship education available to all: Design principles for educational programs stimulating an entrepreneurial mindset. Entrepreneurship Education and Pedagogy, 5(3), 347-374.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><p style="margin: auto 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px"></span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><p style="margin: auto 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">Gulikers, J., &amp; Oonk, C. (2019). Towards a rubric for stimulating and evaluating sustainable learning. Sustainability, 11(4), 969.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><p style="margin: auto 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px"></span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px;"><p style="margin: auto 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Jorre de St Jorre, T., &amp; Oliver, B. (2018). Want students to engage? </span><span style="margin: 0px">Contextualise</span><span style="margin: 0px"> graduate learning outcomes and </span><span style="margin: 0px">assess for</span><span style="margin: 0px"> employability. Higher Education Research &amp; Development, 37(1), 44-57.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"></span></font></p><div style="margin: 0px;"><p style="margin: auto 0px;"><font color="#424242"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">Meyer, H., Riva, E., Logan, F. et al. </span><span style="margin: 0px">Humanising</span><span style="margin: 0px"> higher education through interdisciplinary student-devised assessments. </span><span style="margin: 0px">Humanit</span><span style="margin: 0px"> Soc Sci Commun 12, 1196 (2025). </span></span><a href="https://doi.org/10.1057/s41599-025-05513-4" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" style="margin: 0px;"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; text-decoration-line: underline; line-height: 19px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">https://doi.org/10.1057/s41599-025-05513-4</span></span></a><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif"></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;